\end{minipage}\hfill
\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\linewidth}
\textbf{b)} $59\,000 - 2\,406 - 6\,594$
\end{minipage} [[br]] \textbf{a) (1,0đ)} $= (29\,100 - 19\,100) + (35\,487 - 5\,487) = 10\,000 + 30\,000 = 40\,000$. [[br]] \textbf{b) (1,0đ)} $= 59\,000 - (2\,406 + 6\,594) = 59\,000 - 9\,000 = 50\,000$. [[br]] \textit{(Nguồn: Đề CK1 TH Liên Bảo 2025-2026.)}

